{title:Hear You Me}
{artist:Paramore}
{lang:en}

Intro: [D]  [A]  [Bm]  [G]
{start_of_verse}
[D]   There's no one in town, I know[A].
   You gave us some place to go.[Bm]
   I never said "thank you" for that[G].
   I thought I might get one more chance.[D]
{start_of_verse}
[D]   What would you think of me now[A],
   So lucky, so strong, so proud?[Bm]
   I never said "thank you" for that[G],
   Now I'll n[G]ever have a chance.
{start_of_chorus}
May [D]angels [A]lead yo[G]u in.
[D]Hear you[A] me, my [G]friends.
On sl[D]eepless [A]roads the [Bm]sleeple[G]ss go.
May [D]angels [A]lead yo[G]u in.

